      {
         "id": "SECTION_africa",
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "### In Africa: Adding with Bones\n\nThe first counting marks we know of were made on bones. To add, people did not need a new tool: they simply kept marking. Thousands of years ago people did not yet use the carry. They made continuous marks in a row along the bone: to add 9 + 3, they made 12 marks, one after another, instead of turning ten marks into a ten of the next order (<htcite0>; <htcite1>; <htcite2>).\n\n#### The Game\n\nAdd the two numbers and place on the bone the total number of marks. The raised fingers show the two numbers: count all the fingers together, and then make one mark on the bone for each unit of the result. For example, 9 + 3 = 12, so the bone receives 12 marks.",
               "source": [
                  {
                     "type": 1,
                     "uuid": "a4caa9fe-de1e-49c5-92de-50ed9c22a42d",
                     "text": "History Tracers Team",
                     "page": "Practicing addition",
                     "date_time": {
                        "type": "gregory",
                        "year": "2026",
                        "month": "",
                        "day": ""
                     }
                  },
                  {
                     "type": 1,
                     "uuid": "687a38b5-de0e-4d16-a4d0-8ec87a545ccb",
                     "text": "History Tracers Team",
                     "page": "Running Among the Numbers",
                     "date_time": {
                        "type": "gregory",
                        "year": "2026",
                        "month": "",
                        "day": ""
                     }
                  },
                  {
                     "type": 1,
                     "uuid": "6c071696-8eb9-4bbe-8221-ffd71620c7e3",
                     "text": "History Tracers Team",
                     "page": "Around the World (Counting)",
                     "date_time": {
                        "type": "gregory",
                        "year": "2026",
                        "month": "",
                        "day": ""
                     }
                  }
               ],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<div class=\"atw-game\" data-atw=\"bones\"><p><div class=\"htBoneWrap\"><p class=\"htBonePrompt\" id=\"htBonePrompt\">Add the two numbers: count the raised fingers together, then place the total number of marks on the bone.<br /><center><span id=\"atwaBoneEquation\" class=\"atw-target\"></span></center></p><table class=\"htBoneTable\"><thead><tr><th>Raised fingers</th><th>The bone</th><th>Arrows</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class=\"htBoneHandsCell\"><div class=\"htBoneHands\" id=\"htBoneHands\"></div></td><td class=\"htBoneBoneCell\"><div class=\"htBone\" id=\"htBone\"><div class=\"htBoneFill\"><span id=\"htBoneMarks\"></span></div></div></td><td class=\"htBoneArrowCell\"><div class=\"htBoneArrows\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"fa-solid fa-caret-up htBoneArrow htBoneArrowUp\" id=\"htBoneAdd\" aria-label=\"Add one\"></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"fa-solid fa-caret-down htBoneArrow htBoneArrowDown\" id=\"htBoneRemove\" aria-label=\"Remove one\"></button></div></td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\"display: flex; gap: 8px; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><button type=\"button\" id=\"htBoneNewNumber\" class=\"reset-tutor-btn\">New practice</button> </p><p id=\"htBoneCongrats\" class=\"htBoneCongrats\" style=\"display: none;\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-medal\" style=\"color: gold;\"></i> Congratulations! The marks on the bone match the sum! <i class=\"fa-solid fa-medal\" style=\"color: gold;\"></i></p><p class=\"desc\">The arrows beside the bone add or remove marks.</p><span id=\"atwaBoneHandAltTpl\" class=\"text-store\">Hand with {n} raised fingers</span></div></p></div>",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "html",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ]
      },
      {
         "id": "SECTION_quipu",
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "### In America: Adding with Quipus\n\nThe quipu records numbers with knots on a hanging cord: the units are at the bottom and the tens are stacked above. A knot in the units order is worth 1; when that order reaches ten knots, those ten are removed and one knot is placed in the tens order above. The result appears as one knot in the tens order and the remaining knots in the units order (<htcite0>; <htcite1>).\n\n#### The Game\n\nAdd the two numbers. Place knots in the **Units** order at the bottom of the cord; when that order reaches ten knots, the game removes them and adds one knot to the **Tens** order above. Then keep adding knots in the units until you reach the result. For example, 9 + 3 = 12: after ten knots become one knot in the tens order, add 2 more knots in the units.",
               "source": [
                  {
                     "type": 1,
                     "uuid": "a4caa9fe-de1e-49c5-92de-50ed9c22a42d",
                     "text": "History Tracers Team",
                     "page": "Practicing addition",
                     "date_time": {
                        "type": "gregory",
                        "year": "2026",
                        "month": "",
                        "day": ""
                     }
                  },
                  {
                     "type": 1,
                     "uuid": "6c071696-8eb9-4bbe-8221-ffd71620c7e3",
                     "text": "History Tracers Team",
                     "page": "Around the World (Counting)",
                     "date_time": {
                        "type": "gregory",
                        "year": "2026",
                        "month": "",
                        "day": ""
                     }
                  }
               ],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
