      {
         "id": "SECTION_europe",
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "### In Europe: Adding with Calculi\n\nThe *calculi* organize counting by place value. Adding on the *calculi* means placing the total in the correct columns: a marker below the bar is worth 1 and a marker above the bar is worth 5 (<htcite0>; <htcite1>; <htcite2>).\n\n#### The Game\n\nAdd the two numbers and follow the steps shown below the calculi: start by writing the first number, then add the second number and carry 1 to the tens column. Remember that the units are on the right and the tens to their left, so the carried 1 goes in the tens column.",
               "source": [
                  {
                     "type": 1,
                     "uuid": "a4caa9fe-de1e-49c5-92de-50ed9c22a42d",
                     "text": "History Tracers Team",
                     "page": "Practicing addition",
                     "date_time": {
                        "type": "gregory",
                        "year": "2026",
                        "month": "",
                        "day": ""
                     }
                  },
                  {
