      {
         "id": "SECTION_china",
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "### In Asia (China): Adding with the Suanpan\n\nOn the suanpan, each column represents a place value. To add, move the beads until the columns show the total, carrying one bead to the next column when a column reaches ten (<htcite0>; <htcite1>).\n\n#### The Game\n\nAdd the two numbers and follow the steps shown below the suanpan: start by writing the first number, then add the second number and carry 1 to the tens column. The suanpan has two beads above the bar and five below it in each column.",
               "source": [
                  {
