         "id": "SECTION_japan",
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "### In Asia (Japan): Adding with the Soroban\n\nThe soroban reached Japan from China and follows the same idea: each column is a place value, and the beads represent the digits of the result (<htcite0>; <htcite1>).\n\n#### The Game\n\nAdd the two numbers and follow the steps shown below the soroban: start by writing the first number, then add the second number and carry 1 to the tens column. The soroban has one bead above the bar and four below it in each column.",
